     CALL "EF5G-ANIM-DEF" USING L-ORD EM5-DEF WS-DOK
     MOVE MM-COUNT TO MH-COUNT
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > MM-COUNT
         MOVE MM-NAME(WS-I) TO MH-NAME(WS-I)
         MOVE MM-PARENT(WS-I) TO MH-PARENT(WS-I)
